        <item>
            <title>0.2.10</title>
            <pubDate>Sat, 19 Sep 2026 19:40:19 -0700</pubDate>
            <link>https://github.com/serafimcloud/firstlight-releases/releases/tag/0.2.10</link>
            <sparkle:fullReleaseNotesLink>https://github.com/serafimcloud/firstlight-releases/releases</sparkle:fullReleaseNotesLink>
            <sparkle:version>19</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.2.10</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>15.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description sparkle:format="plain-text"><![CDATA[Privacy and leaderboard fixes

- Join the global leaderboard explicitly in Settings > Privacy. Participation is off by default.
- Leaderboard profiles now open with the activity their owners chose to share and a working friend request action.
- Leaving removes you from global people and app rankings and revokes profile access for people outside your circle.
- Fixed privacy gaps in older API responses, cached profile access and invitation details.
]]></description>
            <enclosure url="https://github.com/serafimcloud/firstlight-releases/releases/download/0.2.10/Firstlight-0.2.10.zip" length="42570108" type="application/octet-stream" sparkle:edSignature="u90dyUJ32aVXE8p/yUmmjAX4qI8bdzioknsZyrnxepyd32m0+xu9kPgY5NbhwALJyOlhDofw1e7WWZIDGsmRCw=="/>
