            <description sparkle:format="plain-text"><![CDATA[Firstlight 0.2.9

- Fix the unavailable-profile error when adding someone from the leaderboard.
- Show whether a friend request is available, or an invite link or code is needed.
- Refresh request availability gracefully when someone's privacy settings change.
]]></description>
